SUMMARY:Information: Tottenham Hale Station: Jay Z concerts at Tottenham 
 Hotspur Stadium on Friday 4 and Saturday 5 September (1700 start): 
 Tottenham Hale station is expected to be extremely busy between 1600 and 
 1800 and between 2230 and 2359. You may find it easier to use 
 Northumberland Park station where additional Greater Anglia and Stansted 
 Express trains will call before and after the match\, please board one of 
 the front 7 coaches for Northumberland Park.
END:VEVENT
